<h3 id="what-s-in-the-emacs-newcomers-presets-theme-things-i-haven-t-been-able-to-figure-out-yet">Things I haven't been able to figure out yet</h3>
<div class="outline-text-3" id="text-what-s-in-the-emacs-newcomers-presets-theme-things-i-haven-t-been-able-to-figure-out-yet">
